{"seq":2,"slug":"deprecation-sunset","title":"废弃与日落流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/deprecation-sunset","wordCount":1628,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"废弃与日落流程\">废弃与日落流程</h1><p>API 废弃（Deprecation）不是删代码——它是与消费者之间服务契约的有序终止程序。一个未经告知的端点移除可能在瞬间击穿下游数百个集成，产生数千张工单和无法估量的信任损失。本文建立从废弃声明到最终移除的完整操作手册，覆盖时间窗口设计、通知策略、HTTP 头部协议、分阶段切换和应急回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>废弃流程的核心概念包括：Deprecation（废弃声明，标记端点不再推荐使用）、Sunset（日落，端点停止服务的确切时刻）、Sunset Window（从废弃到日落之间的缓冲期）、以及 RFC 8594 定义的标准 HTTP Sunset Header。这四个概念构成了有序退出的操作框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"废弃的四阶段模型\">废弃的四阶段模型</h2><p>废弃不是一个事件，而是一个持续数月到数年的分阶段过程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[阶段 1&lt;br/&gt;声明废弃] --&gt; B[阶段 2&lt;br/&gt;通知与观察]&#10;    B --&gt; C[阶段 3&lt;br/&gt;日落执行]&#10;    C --&gt; D[阶段 4&lt;br/&gt;最终移除]&#10;&#10;    A ---|标注 Deprecation Header| A&#10;    B ---|监控使用率&lt;br/&gt;多轮提醒| B&#10;    C ---|返回 410 Gone| C&#10;    D ---|删除路由代码| D\">graph LR\n    A[阶段 1&lt;br/&gt;声明废弃] --&gt; B[阶段 2&lt;br/&gt;通知与观察]\n    B --&gt; C[阶段 3&lt;br/&gt;日落执行]\n    C --&gt; D[阶段 4&lt;br/&gt;最终移除]\n\n    A ---|标注 Deprecation Header| A\n    B ---|监控使用率&lt;br/&gt;多轮提醒| B\n    C ---|返回 410 Gone| C\n    D ---|删除路由代码| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时间点</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>HTTP 状态</th>\n<th>客户端影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明废弃</td>\n<td>T+0</td>\n<td>响应添加 Deprecation Header</td>\n<td>200（正常）</td>\n<td>无功能影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知观察</td>\n<td>T+30d ~ T+sunset</td>\n<td>多渠道提醒 + 使用率监控</td>\n<td>200（正常）</td>\n<td>仅日志告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日落执行</td>\n<td>Sunset Date</td>\n<td>端点返回错误响应</td>\n<td>410 Gone</td>\n<td>功能不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终移除</td>\n<td>Sunset+90d</td>\n<td>路由完全删除</td>\n<td>404 Not Found</td>\n<td>端点消失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶段 3 和阶段 4 之间的 90 天缓冲期是安全网——410 Gone 响应体中包含迁移文档链接，给最后的迟到者一个明确的信号和行动路径。直接从 200 跳到 404 是最糟糕的体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"http-废弃头部协议\">HTTP 废弃头部协议</h2><p>RFC 8594（Sunset Header）和 draft-ietf-httpapi-deprecation-header 定义了标准化的废弃信号机制：</p>\n<h3 id=\"deprecation-header\">Deprecation Header</h3><p>标识端点已进入废弃状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Deprecation: Sun, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT&#10;Link: &lt;https://api.example.com/docs/migration-v1-to-v2&gt;; rel=&quot;deprecation&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Deprecation: Sun, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;https://api.example.com/docs/migration-v1-to-v2>; rel=\"deprecation\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>日期格式表示废弃生效时间。客户端 SDK 检测到此 Header 时应在日志中发出告警。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sunset-header\">Sunset Header</h3><p>标识端点将停止工作的精确时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Sunset: Mon, 30 Jun 2026 23:59:59 GMT&#10;Link: &lt;https://api.example.com/docs/migration-v1-to-v2&gt;; rel=&quot;sunset&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sunset: Mon, 30 Jun 2026 23:59:59 GMT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;https://api.example.com/docs/migration-v1-to-v2>; rel=\"sunset\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个 Header 通常同时出现——Deprecation 标记废弃窗口的开始，Sunset 标记结束。窗口内端点仍正常工作，但客户端应该启动迁移。</p>\n<h3 id=\"完整响应头示例\">完整响应头示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;Deprecation: Sun, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT&#10;Sunset: Tue, 31 Dec 2026 23:59:59 GMT&#10;Link: &lt;https://api.example.com/v2/users&gt;; rel=&quot;successor-version&quot;&#10;Link: &lt;https://api.example.com/docs/v1-to-v2&gt;; rel=&quot;deprecation&quot;&#10;X-API-Warn: &quot;This endpoint is deprecated. Please migrate to /v2/users by Dec 31, 2026.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Deprecation: Sun, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sunset: Tue, 31 Dec 2026 23:59:59 GMT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;https://api.example.com/v2/users>; rel=\"successor-version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Link: &#x3C;https://api.example.com/docs/v1-to-v2>; rel=\"deprecation\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-API-Warn: \"This endpoint is deprecated. Please migrate to /v2/users by Dec 31, 2026.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间窗口设计\">时间窗口设计</h2><p>Sunset 窗口的长度不是任意的——它必须匹配消费者的部署周期和迁移能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消费者类型</th>\n<th>推荐最短窗口</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部微服务（同团队）</td>\n<td>2-4 周</td>\n<td>共享发布日历，沟通成本低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部微服务（跨团队）</td>\n<td>1-3 个月</td>\n<td>需要排期和跨团队协调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作伙伴 API</td>\n<td>6-12 个月</td>\n<td>可能有合同约束和审批流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公共第三方 API</td>\n<td>12-24 个月</td>\n<td>消费者部署周期不可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动客户端相关</td>\n<td>12-18 个月</td>\n<td>App Store 审核 + 用户更新周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>行业参考</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stripe：通常 2 年废弃窗口</li>\n<li>GitHub：最少 24 个月通知</li>\n<li>Google Cloud：1 年通知 + 1 年共存</li>\n</ul>\n<p>时间窗口的确定需要考虑三个维度的最大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{sunset} = \\max(T_{deploy}, T_{contract}, T_{risk})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{deploy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">oy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是消费者最慢部署周期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{contract}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是合同约定的变更通知期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基于迁移复杂度的风险缓冲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多渠道通知策略\">多渠道通知策略</h2><p>仅靠 HTTP Header 不够——很多客户端 SDK 不会主动检查废弃头部。有效的废弃通知需要覆盖多个渠道：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[废弃决策] --&gt; B[渠道 1:HTTP Header]&#10;    A --&gt; C[渠道 2:开发者门户 Changelog]&#10;    A --&gt; D[渠道 3:邮件通知]&#10;    A --&gt; E[渠道 4:SDK 告警]&#10;    A --&gt; F[渠道 5:Dashboard 横幅]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; G[T+0:首次响应即携带]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; H[T+0, T+30%, T+60%, T+90%]&#10;    E --&gt; I[SDK 检测 Header 后本地告警]&#10;    F --&gt; J[管理后台可视化提醒]\">graph TD\n    A[废弃决策] --&gt; B[渠道 1:HTTP Header]\n    A --&gt; C[渠道 2:开发者门户 Changelog]\n    A --&gt; D[渠道 3:邮件通知]\n    A --&gt; E[渠道 4:SDK 告警]\n    A --&gt; F[渠道 5:Dashboard 横幅]\n\n    B --&gt; G[T+0:首次响应即携带]\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; H[T+0, T+30%, T+60%, T+90%]\n    E --&gt; I[SDK 检测 Header 后本地告警]\n    F --&gt; J[管理后台可视化提醒]</pre><p><strong>通知时间线最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>T+0（声明日）</strong>：Changelog 发布 + 邮件通知所有已知消费者 + Header 开始返回</li>\n<li><strong>T+30%</strong>：第一次提醒邮件，附带使用率报告</li>\n<li><strong>T+60%</strong>：第二次提醒，标记仍在使用的客户端</li>\n<li><strong>T+90%</strong>：最终警告，明确告知 Sunset 日期和影响</li>\n<li><strong>Sunset 日</strong>：端点切换为 410 + 监控支持工单</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分阶段流量切换\">分阶段流量切换</h2><p>大型 API 的废弃不宜在 Sunset 日一刀切。推荐分阶段降级：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 A（Shadow Reject）</strong>：在网关层对废弃端点的请求进行标记，但不影响响应。收集精确的调用者列表（按 client_id、API key、IP）。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 B（选择性限流）</strong>：对 Sunset 日期后仍在调用的客户端实施渐进式限流——从 100% 通过逐步降至 50%、10%、0%。限流响应体中包含迁移说明。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 C（Allowlist 模式）</strong>：默认返回 410，但对已知的、正在积极迁移的客户端临时放行（加入 allowlist）。设置 allowlist 的绝对过期时间。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段 D（完全移除）</strong>：allowlist 过期后，删除路由代码。端点返回 404。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应急回滚机制\">应急回滚机制</h2><p>即使做了充分通知，Sunset 执行后仍可能发现遗漏的关键消费者。必须预设回滚路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回滚触发条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sunset 后 P0 工单突增</td>\n<td>网关恢复路由 + 410 降级为 200</td>\n<td>24-72h 评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发现未知的关键合作伙伴</td>\n<td>加入 allowlist + 紧急沟通</td>\n<td>直到迁移完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后继 API 发现严重 Bug</td>\n<td>全量回退到旧版本</td>\n<td>直到修复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>回滚能力要求在 Sunset 执行后的 90 天内，旧版本的代码和基础设施仍然可以快速恢复服务。这也是阶段 3（410）和阶段 4（404+删代码）之间留 90 天缓冲的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"废弃注册表\">废弃注册表</h2><p>组织级的废弃管理需要一个中心化的注册表，记录所有正在废弃中的端点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>endpoint</td>\n<td>被废弃的端点路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>owner_team</td>\n<td>负责团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>deprecated_date</td>\n<td>废弃声明日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sunset_date</td>\n<td>计划日落日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>successor</td>\n<td>后继端点/版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>active_consumers</td>\n<td>当前仍在使用的已知消费者数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>migration_doc</td>\n<td>迁移文档链接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>status</td>\n<td>announcing / warning / sunsetting / removed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个注册表是版本治理的核心操作面板——通过它可以随时回答&quot;哪些端点正在废弃中、有多少人还在用、离 Sunset 还有多远&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>废弃与日落是版本退出的标准操作程序——不是&quot;删代码&quot;，而是&quot;有序终止契约&quot;。成功的废弃流程依赖四个支柱：标准化的 HTTP 头部协议（Deprecation + Sunset Header）、匹配消费者部署周期的时间窗口、覆盖多渠道的通知策略、以及带回滚能力的分阶段执行。废弃注册表提供组织级的全局视图，确保没有端点在无人关注的情况下静默过期。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：废弃流程管理的是旧版本的有序退出。当加性路径走不通、必须引入不兼容变更时，如何用最小代价执行——详见 <a href=\"breaking-change-management\">破坏性变更管理</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"废弃与日落流程","id":"废弃与日落流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"废弃的四阶段模型","id":"废弃的四阶段模型"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 废弃头部协议","id":"http-废弃头部协议"},{"level":3,"text":"Deprecation Header","id":"deprecation-header"},{"level":3,"text":"Sunset Header","id":"sunset-header"},{"level":3,"text":"完整响应头示例","id":"完整响应头示例"},{"level":2,"text":"时间窗口设计","id":"时间窗口设计"},{"level":2,"text":"多渠道通知策略","id":"多渠道通知策略"},{"level":2,"text":"分阶段流量切换","id":"分阶段流量切换"},{"level":2,"text":"应急回滚机制","id":"应急回滚机制"},{"level":2,"text":"废弃注册表","id":"废弃注册表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"加性变更策略与无版本演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/additive-changes"},"next":{"title":"破坏性变更管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/strategies/breaking-change-management"}}